      deliveries have to continue.\u201D\n\nBest not to get too close to that place.\n\nI
      have heard stories about that house too.\n\nDo not go there at night."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5435108979392512
    m_Localized: "Many years ago, the night-shift mail carrier for this area suddenly
